  "body_html": "<p>In this post I’m gonna upload all the photos of my current 2013 trip back home to Bulgaria, that I consider somehow cool. Photos will be uploaded every day so keep updated and click on the photos for full resolution (if you want to). <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/lovers.jpg\"><img alt=\"lovers\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2631\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/lovers-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/ailqk2.jpg\"><img alt=\"ailqk2\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2632\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/ailqk2-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/piano.jpg\"><img alt=\"piano\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2633\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/piano-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/sky.jpg\"><img alt=\"sky\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2636\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/sky-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/ailqk.jpg\"><img alt=\"ailqk\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2639\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/ailqk-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/rihanna.jpg\"><img alt=\"rihanna\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2645\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/rihanna-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/gypsy.jpg\"><img alt=\"gypsy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2655\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/gypsy-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/narodno.jpg\"><img alt=\"narodno\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2656\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/narodno-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a> <a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/smokebw.jpg\"><img alt=\"smokebw\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2657\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/smokebw-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/pes.jpg\"><img alt=\"pes\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2672\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/pes-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/shtastie.jpg\"><img alt=\"shtastie\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2671\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/shtastie-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/kid.jpg\"><img alt=\"kid\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2673\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/kid-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/flag.jpg\"><img alt=\"flag\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2676\" height=\"383\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/flag-1024x682.jpg\" width=\"576\"/></a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrel